{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39574","headline":"喜弟承检登科 · 翁承赞","name":"喜弟承检登科","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两篇佳句敌琼瑰，怜我三清道路开。\n荆璞献多还得售，桂堂恩在敢轻回。\n花繁不怕寻香客，榜到应倾贺喜杯。\n知尔苦心功业就，早携长策出山来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}